flowchart TD
    A[Read student names and marks from CSV] --> B[Validate IDs, names, and marks]
    B --> C{Any missing or invalid values?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Flag record for manual checking]
    C -- No --> E[Calculate total, average, and percentage]
    D --> F[Exclude incomplete record from aggregate calculations]
    E --> G[Aggregate complete-record statistics]
    F --> G
    G --> H[AI summarizes verified statistics]
    H --> I[Generate student performance report]
    I --> J[Human verifies calculations and summary]
    J --> K[Finalize report]
